ord:`map`,ladderStrategyNoMaps:`No maps available in this format.`,packDraftTitle:`Pack Draft`,packBeta:`Beta`,packIntro:`A draft format for 2 players and 4 heroes: all cards go into one pool, are split into packs and drafted, and only then played. Play on one screen and pass the turn between players.`,packBetaNote:`Beta: cards without art show text only.`,packRulesTitle:`Rules`,packRule1:`Choose 4 heroes (with or without sidekicks). Mix all their cards into one shared pool and make 10 packs of 12 cards. Any leftover cards are discarded openly and do not play.`,packRule2:`Each player chooses 1 of the 4 heroes and gets their passive ability and sidekick, if there is one.`,packRule3:`Each player takes a pack of 12 cards, looks through it, keeps 1 card, discards 1 card openly and passes the pack to the opponent. Repeat until the packs are empty, then move on to the next packs.`,packRule4:`From the drafted cards build a 30-card deck. The other drafted cards are set aside (they are not discarded): after a match players may swap them with cards in the deck.`,packRule5:`A card with a hero's name can be played only by the player's main hero, whatever set it comes from. A card with a sidekick's name can be played only by that sidekick; without them it is a dead card. Cards with no name / Any follow the usual Unmatched rules.`,packPlayer1:`Player 1`,packPlayer2:`Player 2`,packRestart:`Restart`,packRestartConfirm:`Click again to confirm`,packNewDraft:`New draft`,packPickHero:`{player}: choose your hero`,packHp:`HP`,packMove:`Move`,packAttack:`Attack`,packAttackMelee:`Melee`,packAttackRange:`Ranged`,packPassive:`Passive`,packSidekick:`Sidekick`,packNoSidekick:`none`,packTurnOf:`{player}'s turn`,packRoundOf:`Round {n} of {total}`,packCardsLeft:`Cards in the pack: {n}`,packKept:`Kept`,packKeepHint:`Select a card to keep`,packDiscardHint:`Select a card to discard openly`,packKeepBtn:`Keep selected card`,packDiscardBtn:`Discard selected card`,packYourKept:`Kept cards`,packDiscardPi